eratorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6CofinalMap}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\alpha\\in f(\\beta)\\lor\\alpha=f(\\beta)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6CofinalMap}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\alpha\\in f(\\beta)\\lor\\alpha=f(\\beta)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The last clause says that the range of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> is cofinal in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; the non-strict ordinal comparison also handles successor targets correctly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda,\\kappa,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CofinalMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6CofinalMap}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\alpha\\in f(\\beta)\\lor\\alpha=f(\\beta)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","dis